Security view: the filter chain and the config, authn, access and audit packages
(text outline of security-view.puml; PlantUML renders class diagrams as text only with Graphviz)

Spring Security filter chain (Intercepting Filter), in request order
  BasicAuthenticationFilter ──authenticate──> ProviderManager ──delegates──> DaoAuthenticationProvider
      DaoAuthenticationProvider ──loadUserByUsername──> authn.DemoUserDetailsService
      bad credentials ──> authn.ApiAuthenticationEntryPoint (401)
  ExceptionTranslationFilter
      anonymous caller      ──> authn.ApiAuthenticationEntryPoint (401)
      authenticated caller  ──> access.ApiAccessDeniedHandler     (403)
  AuthorizationFilter       rules built by access.AccessPolicy
  Method security (@PreAuthorize) ──@ownRecord.allows──> access.OwnRecordGuard
      guards web.PatientController.record / appointments

config
  SecurityConfig «@Configuration»
      api(http, policy, entryPoint, denied) : SecurityFilterChain
      roleHierarchy() : RoleHierarchy            ADMIN > DOCTOR > NURSE
      passwordEncoder() : PasswordEncoder        delegating, {bcrypt}
      authorizationEventPublisher(publisher)
      uses ──> AccessPolicy, ApiAuthenticationEntryPoint, ApiAccessDeniedHandler

authn
  DemoUserDetailsService «UserDetailsService» ──> DemoUsers ◇── 5 DemoUser «record»
      creates ──> ClinicUser (extends User; role, patientId) ──> access.Role
  ApiAuthenticationEntryPoint «AuthenticationEntryPoint» ──> web.ApiError

access
  AccessPolicy ──> AccessRules ◇── 9 AccessRule «record»
      AccessRule ──> Requirement «sealed»
          ◁── PermitAll, Authenticated, AnyRole(roles ──> Role)
  Role {ADMIN, DOCTOR, NURSE, PATIENT}
  OwnRecordGuard «bean "ownRecord"» ── reads patientId ──> authn.ClinicUser
  ApiAccessDeniedHandler «AccessDeniedHandler» ──> web.ApiError

audit
  SecurityEventListener ──record──> AuditLog ◁── InMemoryAuditLog
      receives AuthenticationSuccessEvent, AbstractAuthenticationFailureEvent
               (published by ProviderManager)
      receives AuthorizationDeniedEvent
               (from AuthorizationFilter and method security)
  AuditLog ◇── AuditEntry «record» ──> AuditKind {AUTHN_SUCCESS, AUTHN_FAILURE, AUTHZ_DENIED}

web
  AdminController ──entries──> audit.AuditLog
  PatientController (guarded by method security)
  ApiError «record»
